835 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This limitation not only compromises the safety and security of the residents, but also leads to inefficiencies in energy usage and inconvenience in daily life. Without smart integration, users are unable to react to environmental events promptly, which increases the risk of damage, accidents, and energy waste.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
836 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To solve these issues, this project presents a smart home system that combines various environmental sensors with an ESP32 microcontroller.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
