/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (The MQ-2 sensor is a versatile module capable of detecting a range of flammable gases including methane, LPG, smoke, and hydrogen. It serves as a critical safety feature in the smart home setup. The sensor continuously monitors the air quality, and when the gas concentration exceeds a safe threshold, it sends a signal to the ESP32 to generate an alert. This allows the user to take immediate action, preventing potential accidents or fires caused by gas leaks. It is particularly useful in kitchens, storage rooms, and near gas-operated appliances.)
/E (The MQ-2 sensor is a versatile module capable of detecting a range of flammable gases including methane, LPG, smoke, and hydrogen. It serves as a critical safety feature in the smart home setup. The sensor continuously monitors the air quality, and when the gas concentration exceeds a safe threshold, it sends a signal to the ESP32 to generate an alert. This allows the user to take immediate action, preventing potential accidents or fires caused by gas leaks. It is particularly useful in kitchens, storage rooms, and near gas-operated appliances.)
