/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The system successfully integrated multiple components including the ESP32 microcontroller, a set of environmental sensors, a Node.js backend, a responsive web-based frontend, and Telegram Bot API for instant alerts. All modules communicated smoothly using WebSocket, and the system delivered data and notifications in real time with minimal latency.)
/E (The system successfully integrated multiple components including the ESP32 microcontroller, a set of environmental sensors, a Node.js backend, a responsive web-based frontend, and Telegram Bot API for instant alerts. All modules communicated smoothly using WebSocket, and the system delivered data and notifications in real time with minimal latency.)
/Pg 70 0 R
/K [8]
>>
