1328 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (One practical improvement would be to add an uninterruptible power supply \(UPS\) system or battery backup to the ESP32 and sensors. In the case of a power outage, the system could continue operating for a limited time, or at least send a final alert to the user before shutdown. This feature is especially useful in critical environments where sudden power loss could hide dangerous situations.)
/E (One practical improvement would be to add an uninterruptible power supply \(UPS\) system or battery backup to the ESP32 and sensors. In the case of a power outage, the system could continue operating for a limited time, or at least send a final alert to the user before shutdown. This feature is especially useful in critical environments where sudden power loss could hide dangerous situations.)
/Pg 74 0 R
/K [6]
>>
