/S /H2
/T (Integrating AI and machine learning into the system could allow it to learn user behavior over time. For instance, it could identify patterns in temperature, motion, or light usage, and suggest or automatically apply optimizations. Abnormal patterns could also be flagged as potential threats \(e.g., motion when the house is empty\), adding another layer of intelligence to the home.)
/E (Integrating AI and machine learning into the system could allow it to learn user behavior over time. For instance, it could identify patterns in temperature, motion, or light usage, and suggest or automatically apply optimizations. Abnormal patterns could also be flagged as potential threats \(e.g., motion when the house is empty\), adding another layer of intelligence to the home.)
/Pg 75 0 R
/K [5]
