1387 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (While AI and behavior prediction are not yet part of the current implementation, they are included in our future development plan. This sets a clear roadmap for enhancing automation and intelligence. Commercial products like Google Nest already offer built-in AI features, such as adaptive temperature control. Open-source systems provide frameworks for adding AI manually through plugins or integrations with external AI services.)
/E (While AI and behavior prediction are not yet part of the current implementation, they are included in our future development plan. This sets a clear roadmap for enhancing automation and intelligence. Commercial products like Google Nest already offer built-in AI features, such as adaptive temperature control. Open-source systems provide frameworks for adding AI manually through plugins or integrations with external AI services.)
/Pg 81 0 R
/K [7]
>>
